  &lt;!-- Page Header --&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;text-center mb-5&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h1 class=&quot;fw-bold&quot;&gt;Welcome to &quot;[Portal:PortalName]&quot;&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;p class=&quot;lead text-muted&quot;&gt;
      Thank you for choosing Plant an App and investing your time to explore the platform. 
      Use the information on this page to get started quickly and confidently!
    &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!-- Getting Help --&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;card border-primary shadow-sm mb-5&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h3 class=&quot;card-title text-primary mb-3&quot;&gt;❓ Getting Help &amp;amp; Learning More&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Start Here:&lt;/strong&gt; The 
        &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.plantanapp.com/docs/current/general/welcome&quot; target=&quot;paawelcome&quot; class=&quot;fw-bold text-decoration-none&quot;&gt;Welcome page&lt;/a&gt; 
        in the documentation is the best first step in your Plant an App journey. It gathers key resources, guides, and community links to help you succeed. 
      &lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;p class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;Visit it to explore documentation, training, support, and ways to connect with the community.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!-- Config Section --&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;card shadow-sm mb-5&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h3 class=&quot;card-title mb-3&quot;&gt;⚙️ How to Configure Your Application&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;
        The &lt;strong&gt;Configuration&lt;/strong&gt; option in the top menu above is your gateway into the Plant an App environment, where most app configuration takes place.
      &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!-- About Home Page - critical warning --&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;alert alert-warning fw-bold shadow-sm mb-4&quot; role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;
    ⚠️ Do not delete this Home page! Instead, edit and customize it to suit your needs.
