      &lt;h3 class=&quot;card-title mb-3&quot;&gt;⌂ About This Home Page&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;
        The Home page was created automatically and serves as the default landing page for your Plant an App instance.
      &lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;
        This starter content is here to help you begin configuring your app. As you get comfortable, &lt;i&gt;clear this home page and add your own content&lt;/i&gt;. This page will then be what your end users see when they log in.
      &lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;p class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;
        When you&#39;re ready, use the &lt;em&gt;Clear this Home Page&lt;/em&gt; button below, then begin adding your custom information and features.
      &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

