      &lt;p class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;
        By default, the Home page is &lt;em&gt;visible only to logged-in users&lt;/em&gt;. To make it public, update its &lt;strong&gt;page permissions&lt;/strong&gt; to include all users.
